er he is given  what is thought to be the more dangerous  Mission whereas Luke would go on the  shorter mission to Storm's end not only  is his mission much faster but they also  thought they would win over lord  Baratheon much easier if only he would  have arrived before aemond and vegar  maybe things would have went differently  these final 15 minutes of the episode  were absolutely incredible now I've  always tried to imagine what Storm's end  would look like in my mind but I never  could have imagined this the seed of  house Baratheon was stunning in a very  dark and ominous sort of way when  lucarius landed his dragon and vegar  revealed herself from behind the castle  wall he should have got his ass right  back on his dragon and left he knew that  meant aemon was already there and he  obviously knows they do not like each  other now sure he would have looked soft  if he fled but hey sometimes you have to  live to fight another day as soon as he  walked inside and I saw aemon standing  next to Lord baratheon's daughter I knew  exactly how this would end I mean I've  obviously read Fire and Blood but you  never know what direction the writers  will go in and this scene would show us  they did make some alterations of their  own the reason Amon was standing next to  the daughter is because he already had  agreed to marry one of them something  Luke Aries was not willing to do now his  fate might have already been sealed but  I do wonder what Lord Baratheon would  have done if Lou Carey said he would  marry one of his daughters would that  have swayed him at all I'm not so sure  that it would have considering vegar was  right outside that's obviously not a  dragon you want on your bad side  especially when she's laying right  outside of your door just like in Fire  and Blood when Lou Carey says he cannot  marry his daughter Lord Baratheon sends  him away with a message of his own the  only difference the show left out was  some of the foul language now before  he's able to leave aemon stops him  because he's still angry about losing  his eye and let's be real I don't blame  him for still being upset either when  aemon revealed the sapphire in his eye  it sent a lot of fans into a frenzy I've  seen a lot of the fans on social media  wondering if this means aemon will  become the night king or a white walker  in the future well the answer is no as I  just said the reason why his eye is blue  like that is because he has a sapphire  in his eye it's not because he's some  halfway zombie or anything like that and  let's just say when aemon does  eventually die whether it's in battle or  of old age they do find his body and it  is very obvious it's his body for a few  good reasons so we know he doesn't go  and join the night King's Army so for  anyone wondering his blue sapphire eye  has nothing to do with the night King  the white walkers or the army of the  dead now back outside of Storm's end the  scene becomes genuinely horrifying as  Lou carries and his small Dragon try to  flee from aemond and vegar it feels like  something right out of a scary movie my  eyes damn near fell out of my head when  I saw vagar Fly Above her ax she  literally could have swallowed the  dragon hole if she wanted now if you've  read fire in blood it only seemed that  aemon wanted to kill lucaries however  this scene did not unfold that way here  aemon was having fun in his sick sort of  way the dragons did seem to be listening  to their Riders until they felt like  they were in serious danger then all  bets were off as soon as the racks Let  its flame go vegar was out for a blood  there was nothing aemon could have said  after this and this is what viserys  meant when he said the targaryens having  control over their dragons is only an  illusion aemond look genuinely shocked  by what happened unfortunately for him  and the realm no one will believe him No  One's Gonna think this was an accident  not after how he acted inside Storm's  end everyone will assume he did this as  a way of getting revenge for his eye if  only the dragon died maybe they could  fix it but we all saw the local and  raniera's face at the very end the dance  of the dragons and the war of Fire and  Blood has officially begun her  considering their offer has now gone up  in Flames now it's only a matter of when  and how they will strike back I don't  want to reveal that just yet so there  you have it ladies and gentlemen season  one of House of the Dragon is over like  I said earlier I will be making videos  every week during the off season I still  have a lot to say and it will not be  long before filming on the second season  of House of the Dragon begins like I did  with Game of Thrones I will follow House  of the dragon and make update videos on  everything they do while they're making  the next season so if you're a massive  fan of Game of Thrones House of the  dragon and A Song of Ice and Fire don't  go anywhere just yet there's a lot more  videos heading your way as always I want  to thank all of you for stopping by and  showing some love I hope all of you have  a great day I will see you again very  soon bye  foreign  [Music]  foreign  [Music]
 

